---
const credentials = [
  {
    value: "Sole-source",
    label: "DoD & DoE contract",
    note: "Engineering at Sandia National Laboratories",
  },
  {
    value: "$600M",
    label: "Salt River Project",
    note: "Corporate Engineering Manager; standards now followed by other utilities",
  },
];
---

<section class="section authority" aria-labelledby="authority-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="authority__head reveal">
      <h2 class="authority__title" id="authority-title">
        National-lab engineering, pointed at your building.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="authority__grid">
      <div class="authority__body reveal">
        <p>
          The diagnosis is designed by <strong>Cliff Suljak</strong>, our Chief
          Engineer. Cliff held a sole-source engineering contract with the
          Department of Defense and Department of Energy at Sandia National
          Laboratories, and served as Corporate Engineering Manager on a
          $600&nbsp;million project at the Salt River Project, where standards
          he set are now followed by other utility companies.
        </p>
        <p>
          Here is how it works in practice. Our technicians come to your
          property and capture the readings. Cliff's team designs the program
          from what those readings show. The same engineering judgment the
          federal government relied on for its largest energy and defense
          facilities is the judgment reading your panels.
        </p>
      </div>

      <aside class="authority__creds" aria-label="Credentials">
        {
          credentials.map((c, i) => (
            <div class="cred reveal" style={`--i: ${i}`}>
              <span class="cred__value">{c.value}</span>
              <span class="cred__label">{c.label}</span>
              <span class="cred__note">{c.note}</span>
            </div>
          ))
        }
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .authority {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .authority__head {
    max-width: 54rem;
  }
  .authority__title {
    margin-top: var(--space-xs);
    font-size: var(--step-3);
    max-width: 18ch;
  }
  .authority__grid {
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr;
    gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    align-items: start;
  }
  .authority__body p {
    color: var(--body);
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 52ch;
  }
  .authority__body p + p {
    margin-top: var(--space-m);
  }
  .authority__body strong {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .authority__creds {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-m);
    align-content: start;
  }
  .cred {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.3rem;
    padding: var(--space-m);
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
  }
  .cred__value {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: var(--step-3);
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--gold-text);
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }
  .cred__label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
  }
  .cred__note {
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .authority__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
